WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:02.109
Truffles cost thousands a kilo,

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:04.257
and pigs are banned from finding them.

00:00:04.787 --> 00:00:07.461
Since 1985, Italian hunters have had to

00:00:07.481 --> 00:00:09.256
use trained dogs instead.

00:00:09.786 --> 00:00:11.438
Pigs can smell a truffle from far

00:00:11.458 --> 00:00:13.930
away, but they eat the prize.

00:00:14.459 --> 00:00:16.297
Their hooves also tear up the soil

00:00:16.317 --> 00:00:18.046
where the next truffles grow.

00:00:18.576 --> 00:00:20.224
Smart law or food snobbery?

00:00:20.317 --> 00:00:21.698
Drop your take below.
